profile: minimodel.short-term-memory.v2
updated_utc: 2026-07-01T16:20:00Z
current_state:
  - MiniModel.org is a planned Rust-first peer-to-peer tiny model package exchange and catalog.
  - Source options are user-owned local files/lists, user-triggered Hugging Face metadata discovery, and future consent-based P2P transfer.
  - It references MiRust.com as a one-way talisman source.
  - File Handoff setup is initialized with placeholder-only active intake.
  - Public boundary remains no hosted model weights and no server-side inference.
